<div class="where" style="font-size:9pt">HOTEL · TWO ROOFTOP POOLS · HOUSE DJ · GETSEMANÍ</div>
<div class="feature"><img src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="Selina Cartagena rooftop pool at sunset">
<div><p class="lede" style="font-size:11.5pt">Picture it: the bay turning gold, a house DJ easing the music up as the light goes, and you with a cocktail in hand at the edge of the rooftop pool.</p>
<p style="margin-top:3.5mm">Selina is a hotel set in a restored colonial building on Calle Larga, in Getsemaní, the most colourful and lively neighbourhood in Cartagena, just a short walk from the walled city across the Puente Román. It has two rooftop pools, a rooftop bar and terrace, a courtyard lounge, a coworking space and places to eat on site.</p>
<div class="facts">
<div><b>Address</b><span>Calle Larga No. 8B-148, Getsemaní, Cartagena</span></div>
<div><b>Stay</b><span>Private and shared rooms. Check in 3pm, check out 11am.</span></div>
<div><b>Music</b><span>A house DJ plays sets on the rooftop through the evening</span></div>
<div><b>Opening</b><span>The rooftop bar runs from late afternoon, with DJ sets until around midnight to 1am. Hours change through the year, so check before you go.</span></div>
<div><b>Website</b><span>selina.com/colombia/cartagena</span></div>
<div><b>The crowd</b><span>Sociable travellers, backpackers and digital nomads. Meeting others is easy here.</span></div>
</div></div></div>
<div class="tips"><div class="tip"><h4>TAKE YOUR OWN TOWEL</h4><p>Bring a towel for the rooftop pool and settle in for the afternoon.</p></div>
<div class="tip"><h4>A COCKTAIL IN THE POOL</h4><p>Order from the bar and enjoy it in the water as the sun sets over the bay.</p></div></div><div class="pgfoot"><span>COLOMBIA CLASSICS</span><span>04</span></div></section><section class="pg"><div class="eyebrow">THE ROOFTOPS · 02 AND 03</div><div class="venue"><div class="art"><div class="frame"><svg viewBox="0 0 160 224" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice"><defs><linearGradient id="g2" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#C8456E"/><stop offset=".45" stop-color="#E07A5F"/><stop offset=".72" stop-color="#F3B37A"/></linearGradient><radialGradient id="r2"><stop offset="0" stop-color="#FDEBB8" stop-opacity="0.75"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#FDEBB8" stop-opacity="0"/></radialGradient></defs>
