 fill="#F6EEDF"/><rect x="15" y="192.5" width="130" height="19" rx="9.5" fill="#5CCACB"/><g stroke="#fff" stroke-width="1" fill="none" opacity=".85"><path d="M26 199 q7 -3 14 0 t14 0 t14 0 t14 0 t14 0 t14 0 t14 0"/><path d="M34 206 q7 -3 14 0 t14 0 t14 0 t14 0 t14 0 t14 0"/></g></svg></div><div class="num">10</div></div><div><h3>Urania Rooftop</h3><div class="where">4TH FLOOR · OLD TOWN · SOPHIA HOTEL</div><div style="margin:0 0 3.5mm -2mm"><span class="badge" style="background:#B8913A">MID PRICE</span></div><p>An elegant pool bar on the boutique Sophia Hotel, with wide views over the city and the ocean.</p>
<div class="meta"><div><b>On the menu</b><br>Signature cocktails, Caribbean bites and brunch</div><div><b>Cocktails</b><br>COP 45,000 to 60,000</div><div><b>The crowd</b><br>Relaxed and elegant, mostly couples and hotel guests.</div><div><b>Dress code</b><br>Casual chic</div><div><b>Address</b><br>Cl. 32 #4-45, Cartagena</div><div><b>Website</b><br>sophiahotel.com.co</div></div>
