<div class="also"><div><h4>Mar y Zielo</h4><p>A cosy gastrobar with a lush rooftop overlooking the cathedral, cooking with flavours from across Colombia. Cra. 5 #34-63.</p><span class="w">MARYZIELO.COM</span></div>
<div><h4>Rooftop La Cata</h4><p>A colourful, low key terrace and pool at the Santa Catalina Hotel, with tapas and cocktails. Cra. 5 #33-15.</p><span class="w">SANTACATALINAHOTEL.COM.CO</span></div>
<div><h4>Daisy the Rooftop</h4><p>The Great Gatsby styled rooftop of La Jugada Club House, buzzing with DJ sets late into the night. Cra. 6 #34-25.</p><span class="w">INSTAGRAM @LAJUGADACLUBHOUSE</span></div></div><div class="hero" style="margin-top:7mm"><div><h3>Before you go up</h3><p>Sunset in Cartagena comes quickly, usually between half past five and six. Arrive early, order something cold, and let the city change colour around you.</p></div><div><h3>Kay&#39;s tip</h3><p>Pace your evening. Start high with a view, then wander down into Getsemaní for dinner and live music.</p></div></div><div class="pgfoot"><span>COLOMBIA CLASSICS</span><span>09</span></div></section><section class="pg"><div class="eyebrow">CHOOSE YOUR EVENING</div><h2 style="font-size:26pt;margin-top:3mm">Budget, mid price or a real treat</h2>
<p class="lede" style="font-size:11.5pt;margin-top:4mm">Some nights call for a pool, a DJ and new friends. Others call for linen, candlelight and a table with the best view in town. Here's how the rooftops compare.</p>
<div class="cols">
<div class="col" style="border-top-color:#2F7F86"><h3>Budget</h3><div class="sub2">Cocktails from around COP 38,000 to 45,000</div><ul><li><b>Selina Cartagena</b>Rooftop pools, a house DJ and the easiest place to meet people</li><li><b>51 Sky Bar</b>From COP 38,000</li><li><b>Alquímico</b>Around COP 45,000</li></ul></div>
<div class="col" style="border-top-color:#B8913A"><h3>Mid price</h3><div class="sub2">Cocktails around COP 45,000 to 60,000</div><ul><li><b>Casa Pura Rooftop</b>COP 45,000 to 60,000</li><li><b>Townhouse Rooftop</b>Around COP 55,000</li><li><b>Buena Vida Rooftop</b>COP 50,000 to 60,000</li><li><b>Urania Rooftop</b>COP 45,000 to 60,000</li></ul></div>
<div class="col" style="border-top-color:#C8456E"><h3>A real treat</h3><div class="sub2">Dinner, wine and the full experience</div><ul><li><b>Mirador Culture Bar</b>COP 50,000 to 75,000</li><li><b>Apogeo Restaurante &amp; Rooftop</b>COP 50,000 to 60,000</li><li><b>Alyzia Rooftop &amp; Dining</b>Around COP 60,000</li></ul></div></div>
